==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|strāle}} {{g|f}} (rarely {{g|m}}), from {{inh|de|goh|strāla}} {{g|f}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*strēlō|g=f|t=arrow, ray, beam}}, from {{inh|de|ine-pro|[[*strēl-]], [[*strēlā-]]||arrow, beam}}. Compare {{cog|nl|straal}}, {{cog|en|streal}}.

